# Build artifacts
/agentsmemory
/server
*.exe
# `go build ./clients/claude-code` names its output after the package directory,
# which is neither of the two above — two 26 MB Mach-O binaries reached the
# index that way before internal/repohygiene started failing on them.
/claude-code
/clients/claude-code/claude-code
# local cross-builds of the CLI (dist/aiagentmemory)
/dist/

# Agent tool runtime state: session ids and absolute paths, regenerated on use.
/.pi/

# Local SQLite databases and WAL/shm sidecars
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Secrets / local env
.env
.env.docker
# hosted-mode env (docker-compose.prod.yml) — session key, OAuth, billing
.env.prod
# local graphify tool output
graphify-out/

# Tooling caches
/.serena/

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Claude Code session state, worktrees and local agent config — never the repo's business
# The directory is local except the one file that carries the project permissions:
# a committed settings.json is what lets auto mode run this repository's own gates
# without a prompt on every machine, not only the one that first approved them.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# ADR-036: the REAL fact-retrieval corpus and the real bootstrap transcript.
# ADR-003 T2 closed this permanently — case files carry queries and drawer ids
# from a private palace. The repo carries synthetic fixtures and redacted
# manifests instead; these patterns keep the real ones from ever being staged.
internal/palace/testdata/factcases-real*.jsonl
internal/palace/testdata/bootstrap-baseline-real*.json

# claude-mem writes an empty <claude-mem-context> CLAUDE.md into any directory it
# touches. Inside the plugin that is not inert: the loader treats every .md in
# commands/ as a slash command, so one shipped as /CLAUDE with generated activity
# notes as its body, and counted against the always-on token budget.
clients/claude-code/CLAUDE.md
clients/claude-code/**/CLAUDE.md
clients/claude-code/clients/
